    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75482" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρχ-ηστήρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆρος</span>,
			ὁ, = sq., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοῦροι ὀρχηστῆρες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					18.494
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
